  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3cf711bd06ef4f479a2906fc1414ca9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vieja17_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.Dialogues.DialoguesData
  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - Some <color=#FF00FF>binoculars...</color> why show me this? They're broken and
    useless. Although...
  - '*She turns them*'
  - <color=yellow>SELENE!</color> That was her name. The name of <color=yellow>my
    best friend.</color> Now I remember...
  - It was with her that I used to play dolls in the forest.
  - It was with her that we used to spy on the warriors while they trained.
  - I remember our little adventures, how much fun we had together. I'd love to see
    her again...
